    "cell": "Sample costs and coverage!B10"
   },
   "explainer": "Based on estimate for Burkina Faso scale-up reaching 83% of the population, further adjusted for country radio ownership rates. Based on a third-party evaluation of monthly listeners to various radio stations in Kano. Freedom Radio reaches 5.6 million listeners, 40% of which are women of reproductive age. The radio station claim that it reaches 10 million listeners (4 million women of reproductive age). The station covers a geographical area of at least 20 million (the whole of Kano as well as large portions of surrounding states.)\n\nIf we did the same calculation as done for the other countries we would find:  20,000,000 (people)*21%(proportion of women in reproductive age)*70% (estimated percent of women reached with radio) = 2,940,000",
   "format": "percent"
  },
  {
   "id": "women_reached_kano",
   "label": "Women reached (Kano)",
   "section": "sample_costs_and_coverage",
   "formula": "women_of_reproductive_age * estimated_of_women_reached",
   "expected": 2240000.0
  },
  {
